# Technical Context

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Notes |
|-------|-----------|-------|
| Language | [TypeScript / Python / Go] | [Strict mode / type hints required] |
| Frontend | [Next.js 14 / React / Vue] | [App Router / SPA] |
| Backend | [Express / FastAPI / Gin] | |
| Database | [PostgreSQL / MongoDB / DynamoDB] | [via Prisma / Mongoose / AWS SDK] |
| Auth | [NextAuth / Clerk / Custom JWT] | |
| Hosting | [Vercel / AWS / GCP] | |
| CI/CD | [GitHub Actions / GitLab CI] | |

## Development Setup

| Action | Command | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Install | `[pnpm install]` | [Do NOT use npm or yarn] |
| Dev server | `[pnpm dev]` | [Runs on localhost:3000] |
| Test | `[pnpm test -- --watchAll=false]` | [< 1 min target] |
| Lint | `[pnpm lint]` | [Zero errors required] |
| Type check | `[pnpm tsc --noEmit]` | |
| Build | `[pnpm build]` | [Must pass before PR] |
| DB migrate | `[pnpm prisma migrate dev]` | |

## Environment

- Local env file: `[.env.local]` (never commit)
- Copy from: `[.env.example]`
- Required vars: `[DATABASE_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL, AUTH_SECRET]`

## Key Dependencies

| Package | Purpose | Docs |
|---------|---------|------|
| [prisma] | [ORM / database access] | [prisma.io/docs] |
| [zod] | [Input validation / schemas] | [zod.dev] |
| [tailwindcss] | [Styling] | [tailwindcss.com/docs] |

## Technical Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|----------|-----------|
| [pnpm over npm] | [Faster installs, strict dependency resolution] |
| [Server components by default] | [Reduce client JS bundle size] |
| [Prisma over raw SQL] | [Type safety, migration management] |
